        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SDL25, Standard Duty Solid Brass Pocket Door Privacy Lock</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor use on sliding pocket doors, the Privacy Pocket Door Lock is for use on doors that may need to be locked for privacy such as those found on bathrooms and bedrooms. An emergency turn on the exterior can unlock it. Standard duty, it is for for use on 1-3/8\" thick pocket doors. The Privacy Solid Brass Pocket Door Pull has a built in flip out edge pull, to get the sliding door out of its pocket. Easy to install, it comes packaged with all mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Pocket Door Privacy Lock:</b> Locks but has access to unlock from the outside via emergency turn. Privacy locks do not offer security, they offer privacy.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"332\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SDL25-Specifications.gif?v=1704354512\" width\"332\" height=\"236\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana SDL25 Pocket Door Privacy Set Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-pocket-door-pull-set-deltana-sdp25\">Pocket Door Passage Set</a> and <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-privacy-pocket-door-lock-deltana-sdla325\">Pocket Door Lock for 1-3/4\" Thick Doors</a>\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana SDL25 Pocket Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Height:  2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Depth: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection:  1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" </li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout: 2-1/4\" High by 1-3/4\" Deep </li>\r\n<li>Emergency lock release on outside.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with matching finish screws and strike plate.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDL25.pdf?v=1691095375\" target=\"new\">Deltana SDL25 Specifications Diagram (PDF)</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/SDL25-install.pdf?v=1691095378\" target=\"new\">Deltana SDL25 Installation Instructions (PDF)</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Privacy Pocket Door Lock, Deltana SDL25",
                "description": "Pocket Door Lock Deltana SDL25 - For use on sliding pocket doors, the Privacy Pocket Door Lock is for use on doors that may need to be locked for privacy such as those found on bathrooms and bedrooms. An emergency turn on the exterior can unlock it. Standard duty, it is for for use on 1-3/8 inch thick pocket doors. The Privacy Solid Brass Pocket Door Pull has a built in flip out edge pull, to get the sliding door out of its pocket. Easy to install, it comes packaged with all mounting hardware. Available in 10 finishes. \r\n",
                "keywords": "DEL-SDL25, SDL25, del-SDL25u3, del-SDL25u10b, del-SDL25u15, pocket door catch, del-SDL25u5, del-SDL25u26, deltana pocket locks, pocket door locks, pocket privacy locks, Deltana SDL25 solid brass sliding door pocket locks, Privacy Pocket Door Locks, locks sliding doors, lock for pocket doors, del-sdl25 pocket door privacy locks, pocket doors privacy locks, Pocket Door Hardware. pocketdoor locks, Solid Brass Pocket Door Lock Privacy, Standard Pocket Door Locks,"
